  "summary": "A new local complex-vector-bundle example separates strong convexity of every fixed fiber from a positive quadratic margin on a total-space neighborhood, even when the squared norm is plurisubharmonic. The inactive 64-line fragment has two complete final manual reads and 20 mathematical checks. It adapts the quadratic maximum of Fukuoka--Setti arXiv:2610.12108v1, Example 3.18, with a separate total-space plurisubharmonicity proof and a frame-invariance check. No general smoothing or curvature-convergence theorem is adopted. All 419 book files, both catalogue files and both original manifests stay byte-exact to656.",
